#: kmymoney2/wizards/newaccountwizard/kaccounttypepagedecl.ui:191
msgid ""
"<p><b>Checking</b>\n"
"Use the checking account type to manage activities on your checking account e.g. payments, checks and cash card purchases.</p>"
